---
title: CI/CD pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    dev([Developer]) -->|git push| repo[(Git repo)]
    repo --> ci{{CI runner}}
    subgraph build [Build & Test]
        direction TB
        lint[Lint] --> unit[Unit tests] --> img[[Build image]]
    end
    ci --> lint
    img --> scan{Vulnerabilities?}
    scan -- yes --> fail[/Notify team/]:::bad
    scan -- no --> reg[(Registry)]
    reg --> stg[Deploy staging] --> e2e[E2E tests]
    e2e -->|pass| prod[Deploy production]:::good
    e2e -.->|fail| fail
    classDef good fill:#2e7d32,stroke:#1b5e20,color:#fff
    classDef bad fill:#c62828,stroke:#8e0000,color:#fff
